# Online play: accounts, progress records, world leaderboard and streaks.
# Create a project at https://supabase.com, then copy these two values from
# Project Settings > API. Both are safe to ship in a client build: the anon key
# only grants what the row level security policies in supabase/schema.sql allow.
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill it in. Without these the game still runs,
# just as a local single-player game with no sign-in and no leaderboard.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
